From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3dx10_43: sprites, fonts, meshes, pump paths, texture loading and operations (3592)

d3dx10_43: sprites, fonts, meshes, pump paths, texture loading and operations

ID3DX10Sprite renders (Begin/Flush/End state machine, sorting, save state,
immediate drawing); ID3DX10Font keeps a glyph atlas and draws text; the
ID3DX10Mesh object is real (buffers, adjacency, GS adjacency, clone,
optimize, intersect, device buffers, draw); the compile, preprocess, effect,
effect pool and shader resource view loaders run through a thread pump and the
D3DX10CreateAsync*Processor exports exist; load info is honoured (size,
format, mip chain generation including block compressed formats, usage,
bind and access flags, volume textures, texture arrays); FilterTexture,
LoadTextureFromTexture and SaveTextureTo{File,Memory} work.
